# cw-tune-ssb: the control of the other half of the visibility rule of the CW tune
# widget (issue #122): outside CW/CWR the widget is not shown.
#
# The widget is created for the main screen whatever the mode is (src/main_screen.c
# calls cw_tune_init()), so this fixture builds the plain main screen in USB with
# the Tuner parameter at its boot value and codifies that the object is there but
# hidden — and that cw_tune_ui_visible() (the gate the tone feed of src/cw.cpp
# consults) says so too. Without this fixture the rule "shown in CW/CWR" would be
# the only half covered, and a widget shown in every mode would pass.
#
# The theme is the radio's own (Redshift), same as the CW fixtures.

name cw-tune-ssb
screen cw-tune-ssb

theme Redshift
seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
